WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.339
Explain purposes of human creation and ways to protect living things.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.198
In the faith stories studied, human beings are called to care for other creatures,

00:00:10.198 --> 00:00:15.195
worship and serve God. Plants provide food and medicines; animals may provide food or

00:00:15.195 --> 00:00:15.909
help people.

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:21.863
Clean air, water and healthy soil support life. We show responsibility by planting

00:00:21.863 --> 00:00:24.207
trees and disposing of rubbish properly.

00:00:25.033 --> 00:00:29.438
With your teacher, list three living things around the school and a safe way to

00:00:29.438 --> 00:00:30.025
protect each.
